			"Message": "refactor(Wind): Update ESBuild config and remove legacy build artifacts\n\nThis commit streamlines the build configuration and artifact management for the `Wind` UI service layer. The primary change involves updating the `Target` ESBuild configuration (`Source/Configuration/ESBuild/Target.ts`) to disable external package bundling for Tauri APIs and `@codeeditorland/output`, ensuring these dependencies are included in the browser target build.\n\nAdditionally, the commit removes a collection of outdated build artifacts and mocks from the `Target/` directory and `Source/Mocks/`, effectively cleaning up the compilation output. The `package.json` has been pruned to remove Jest and Vitest testing dependencies and scripts, aligning the environment with the current build strategy (likely relying on ESBuild's internal checks or separate tooling).\n\nThe generated JS files in `Configuration/ESBuild/` reflect the updated TypeScript source, confirming the build pipeline is processing the new configuration correctly.",
			"SHA": "3cae01883b39497e0a7a2b24d1448e2b49bdcc3c"
